.TH "INVOX-VERSION" 1 "" "invox" "invox manual"
.SH NAME
invox-version \- Show the invox version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Show the invox version.

Usage:
  invox version [flags]

Global flags:
      --config string   Read this config file instead of config.yaml
  -h, --help            Show help for a command
      --no-input        Never prompt or open an editor; fail with exit 2 instead

Examples:
  $ invox version
  $ invox --version
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBinvox\fP(1)
